WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
And so if a young person comes to me and
says I've got an ambition

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.700
and I want to write a play, I've just got
okay then, here's a book,

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.240
this is how you write characters, this is
how you write, see what

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:11.740
you can do.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.720
And if they've come up with a concept or
an idea, we support that

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:20.740
idea from the initial writing right up to

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:24.000
the production, so there was a young
person that came up to us.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.900
an idea about do you learn more in school
or do you learn more in

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.220
in community and

00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:35.060
it became the the production was called
Battle of the Mines and so

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:35.660
they came

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.800
with that idea we turned it into a
production and the book.
